#. Description of the plugin
#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php
msgid "Holiday Mode toggle that hides and restores all of a vendor's listings, with an on-site banner while active and an away notice on the vendor's public profile. Restoring respects each listing's own expiry date, so a holiday never buys a listing extra visible time."
msgstr ""

