msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:820
msgid "Holiday mode only ever touches listings in the statuses ticked below. Anything else, including unfinished listings and the bin, is left alone."
msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:825
msgid "Statuses to Hide"
msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:826
msgid "Narrowing this changes only what a future holiday hides: listings already hidden still come back to the status they had. Unticking every box is read as all four."
msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:835
msgid "Restoring Listings"
msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:836
msgid "Listings come back when a vendor switches holiday mode off. This section decides whether a lapsed HivePress Membership is allowed to stand in the way."
msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:841
msgid "Membership Required to Restore"
msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:842
msgid "Ask a vendor to renew a lapsed membership before their listings come back"
msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:843
msgid "With this ticked, a vendor whose HivePress Membership has lapsed must renew before their listings come back. It only takes effect where HivePress Memberships is active and covers listings. Leave unticked unless you deliberately want that gate."
msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:851
msgid "Removing the Plugin"
msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:852
msgid "Your settings are kept if you delete this plugin, whatever the delete screen's generic warning says, unless you tick the box below. Deleting the plugin always brings hidden listings back first."
msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:857
msgid "Delete All Data"
msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:858
msgid "Delete this plugin's settings when the plugin is deleted"
msgstr ""

#: holiday-mode-for-hivepress.php:859
msgid "With this ticked, deleting the plugin also removes every setting on this page, with no confirmation step and no undo. Either way, deleting restores every hidden listing and switches holiday mode off for everyone."
msgstr ""

